# [MOQ](../wg/moq.html)

## Summary

The MOQ working group held a virtual interim session to discuss administrative updates for upcoming meetings and address open pull requests and issues on [draft-ietf-moq-transport](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-moq-transport/) (Media over QUIC Transport). Key technical topics included parameter naming/inversion for track pausing, receiver state machine additions for object existence, mandatory track properties extensibility, cache update rules for properties, redirect semantics across track namespaces, end-to-group signaling interaction with object filtering, and encoder redundancy.

